	<div style="background-color:;display:block !important;" class="p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:36:22">
<div style="flex:1" className={styles.pvlColumn} class="column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:36:22-1:1 Column:0">
<h6 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:1:68">Hunger Relief</h6>
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:2:20">Food Pantry</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:3:89">
	The Salvation Army provides bags of food to over 50 families in need in Wake County each week,&nbsp;thanks to donations from the community and generous support from the Food Bank of Central and Eastern North Carolina.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:81">
	To schedule an appointment, call&nbsp;<a href="tel:919836733" target="">919-834-6733</a>
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:5:27"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:7:9">
	<strong>FOOD PANTRY ASSISTANCE</strong>
</p>
<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:8:7">
	<li>Available Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays 1 - 1:45 pm</li>
	<li>Each household is allowed 1-3 bags every three months</li>
</ul>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:9:1"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:10:74">
	<strong>Requirements:</strong>
</p>
<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:11:84">
	<li>Proof of Wake County residency</li>
	<li>Photo I.D. for the applicant</li>
	<li>One form of ID for any additional household members<ul>
		<li>ex. photo I.D., health insurance card, shot record, school record</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:12:11"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:13:60"><strong>DONATIONS</strong></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:14:87">To donate non-perishable items, please drop them off at the following times:</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:15:92">Monday - Thursday: 8:00 am - 5:00 pm</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:16:9">Friday: 8:00 am - 2:00 pm</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:17:71"><strong>Judy D. Zelnak Center of Hope</strong></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:18:64">1863 Capital Blvd.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:19:6">Raleigh NC 27604</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:20:71">
	<a href="https://goo.gl/maps/NGjTuCJjDgjnG8tK9"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Directions</span></a>
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:21:44"></div>
